        <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed font-sans">
          Selamat karena berhasil menemukan akses ke Goa Rahasia! Sebagai hadiah eksklusif ala registry
          <span class="font-mono text-[#e5e5e5]">chanhdai.com</span>, kamu bebas melihat, menyalin, atau mengunduh
          kode asli dari <strong class="text-[#ffffff]">seluruh {vaultItems.length} komponen</strong> di website portofolio ini &mdash;
          termasuk <strong class="text-[#ffffff]">Karakter Pixel Vaskrona</strong> beserta meja monitornya.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Filter Tabs + Search Input + Download All JSON Bundle -->
      <div class="mt-7 flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 font-mono text-xs" role="tablist" aria-label="Filter kategori komponen">
          {[
            { key: 'all', label: `All (${vaultItems.length})` },
            { key: 'pixel', label: 'Pixel & Secret' },
            { key: 'interactive', label: 'Interactive UI' },
            { key: 'sections', label: 'Sections' },
            { key: 'styles', label: 'Core CSS' },
          ].map((tab, idx) => (
            <button
              type="button"
              data-vault-filter={tab.key}
              class={`vault-filter-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md border transition-all cursor-pointer ${
                idx === 0
                  ? 'border-[#e5e5e5] bg-[#e5e5e5] text-[#0a0a0a] font-bold'
